{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","魔渊之引"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤黑洞持续将敌人向中心吸引并造成伤害，黑洞中心处生命较低的敌人会被直接击败。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，召唤中心区域半径为1格的黑洞持续5秒，黑洞每0.25秒对中心区域内的敌人造成16% + 2% ATK伤害，每0.25秒对中心区域外、距离4格以内的敌人造成6% + 1% ATK的伤害，并将所有敌人朝中心区域吸引，敌人距离黑洞中心越近受到的吸引力越大。处于黑洞中心区域的敌人，在当前生命值低于迪尔格雷600% + 20% ATK且生命值比例低于15% + 1%时会被立即击败。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":87,"end":92,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":161,"end":167,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":182,"end":187,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":85,"end":96,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":157,"end":171,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至17% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至7% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至18% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至8% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至19% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至9% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至20% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至10% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":51,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","厄难之灾"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤暗黑法球对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤3枚暗黑法球，依次向敌方最密集区域发射对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成65% + 7% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至70% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至75% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至80% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","巫影魔爪"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用魔法抓取最近的敌人，并将其砸向敌方最密集区域。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用魔法将最靠近自己的1名敌人抓到半空禁锢1秒，随后将其砸向敌方最密集区域并使其倒地0.5秒，对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成150% + 10% ATK伤害。优先选择范围内不处于霸体或稳定状态的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":88,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":91,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至180% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身暴击提高18点，终极技能“魔渊之引”击败过敌人后额外提高12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身暴击提高24点，终极技能“魔渊之引”击败过敌人后额外提高16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身暴击提高30点，终极技能“魔渊之引”击败过敌人后额外提高20点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","邃黯回响"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","模仿记忆中的术式，在战斗开始时增强自身并对敌方发动攻击。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","模仿梅林释放过且令人记忆深刻的术式，在战斗开始时，迪尔格雷依次释放以下技能：\n启明术：使自身获得30点急速持续8秒，持续期间处于霸体状态；\n禁锢术：对最靠后的1名敌人造成25% ATK伤害，并将其禁锢1.5秒，被禁锢的敌人无法行动；\n星陨术：制造一道黑暗焰流攻击场上所有敌人，对其造成40% ATK真实伤害，并使其攻击速度降低20点持续5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":75,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":85,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":142,"end":149,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","黑暗焰流的伤害提升至45% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","若梅林出现在敌方战场，则在战斗开始时将其沉默8秒，沉默期间梅林无法释放技能，其原本在战斗开始时释放的技能会在沉默结束后释放，当沉默结束时，迪尔格雷损失5%当前生命值；若梅林未出现在敌方战场，则战斗开始时使自身永久提高10%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","黑暗焰流的伤害提升至50% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","额外获得初始能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","额外获得200点初始能量。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","黯影魔杖"]]}